00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:37.577
And we want to try to be able to help and
ensure that we're hearing the the voices

00:09:37.577 --> 00:09:39.880
of as many different people as possible.

00:09:40.120 --> 00:09:43.280
And so those are some of the things that
we're we're moving forward.

00:09:43.560 --> 00:09:48.943
And we have asked the tribal liaison to
also set up a specific meeting that's not

00:09:48.943 --> 00:09:52.422
